  "notes": [
    "Synthetic-copy apply+rollback only; production apply/rollback not admitted by C5 0.2/0.3.",
    "snapshot.tracker.ready probes EA010_HERMES_BRIDGE_CONFIG writer (api_origin/project_id/token); EA010_HERMES_UI_PROFILE supplies device browser_origin/timeout only.",
    "Readiness uses http.client+_DeadlineSocket with one absolute monotonic deadline across connect/headers/body; no env proxy discovery, no redirect following; requires JSON array; invalid readiness config fails closed without 503.",
