    "Bridge.recover default allow_first_http=True preserves s06 first-deliver for non-UI callers.",
    "Playwright/Chromium pins are reused from the admitted C5 document without network install.",
    "Readiness reuses BridgeConfig+VikunjaClient/_normalize_api_origin+TokenRef.load before any Authorization; failed UI recover stamps last_check into outbox so snapshot retains availability.",
    "Successful deliver/recover link clears obsolete no-first diagnostics (last_check_outcome=confirmed); nonlinked recover persists last_check_outcome/last_explicit_check/reason for denied and dependency_unavailable through Core.snapshot."
  ],
